sections.text:
Common mistakes include:
drawing beautifully without solving the brief;
ignoring the site, sun, wind and access;
copying a style without understanding it;
leaving structure, services and escape routes until the last week;
treating software output as correct;
missing the building code or planning requirement that applies;
and failing to record sources in history and theory essays.

Another mistake is not asking for help early. Studios are public; show unfinished work and learn from the questions.
